  how: "1. Target the four golden segments: braces/ortho patients, implant patients, gum-disease patients, and “I never floss” confessors.\n2. Lead with the ADA Seal — it answers the trust question before it's asked.\n3. Demo with water pressure settings: start low, show the massage mode for sensitive gums.\n4. Cross-sell the right tips (ortho tip, plaque seeker for implants) with every unit.",
  objections: "“Is it a gimmick?” — 80+ clinical studies and an ADA Seal say otherwise; hand them the clinical research summary link.\n“String floss is cheaper” — The best floss is the one the patient will actually use every day. Compliance beats price.",
