  how: "1. Ask every existing Waterpik owner “which tip are you using?” — most only know the classic one.\n2. Match tip to treatment: patient just got an implant, bridge or braces? That's a tip sale.\n3. Attach a spare tip pack to every water flosser sale — families share the unit but never the tip.",
